Changed the NIST CVE Search Job to set a CVE's CVSS base score and severity from the highest CVSS version available (v4.0, v3.1, v3.0, then v2). CVSS v2 severity is always derived from the base score.
Changed the NIST CVE Search Job to no longer populate the legacy `cvss_v2` and `cvss_v3` fields. Existing values are left unchanged.
